{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59881","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7","summary":"AIOHTTP: WebSocket client accepts compressed frames without negotiated permessage-deflate","description":"### Summary\n\nThe client accepts and decompresses frames with the RSV1 bit set even when the `permessage-deflate` extension was not negotiated.\n\n### Impact\n\nA client may unexpectedly decompress WebSocket frames when explicitly opted out. This could lead to additional CPU/memory consumption, but is unlikely to be a significant issue unless a zip bomb vulnerability or similar is also present.\n\n---\n\nPatch: https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/commit/47fb6ae354d4fa22048f4dbe7dbf82b625f0a2f6","type":"reviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aio-libs/aiohttp/security-advisories/GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7","source_code_location":"https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-59881","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/security/advisories/GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59881","https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/pull/12978","https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/commit/47fb6ae354d4fa22048f4dbe7dbf82b625f0a2f6","http://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/releases/tag/v3.14.2","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mq44-7p77-q5h7"],"published_at":"2026-08-03T20:40:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T20:40:56Z","github_reviewed_at":"2026-08-03T20:40:55Z","nvd_published_at":"2026-07-30T19:18:33Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"pip","name":"aiohttp"},"vulnerable_version_range":"<= 3.14.1","first_patched_version":"3.14.2","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI